# info.uis -- Hilfe > Info (dlg_misc.s): the modal window "Info" (WINID_DLG0 + 0x58 = 24680)
# with name, version, origin, trademark note, the diagnostics (read-only) and "In die
# Zwischenablage kopieren"; the web items of the Hilfe menu stay disabled.
size 1280 800
theme light
click #711
expect menuitem:"Info" enabled
expect menuitem:"Forum" disabled
click menuitem:"Info"
expect window 24680 open
expect window 24680 modal
expect text:"PaintCraft" exists
expect #6403 exists
shot build/tests/info.png window 24680
click #6402
clip expect text
click button:"Schließen"
expect window 24680 closed
cmd 728
expect window 24680 open
key esc
expect window 24680 closed
